---
import {FIELDS,format,type Water,type Field} from '../data/schema';
import {equivalentWeights,ferruginosa} from '../rules/chemistry';
const {water:w}=Astro.props as {water:Water};
const ions=Object.entries(equivalentWeights).map(([k,eq])=>({key:k,label:FIELDS[k as Field][0],value:w.composition[k as Field]?.qualifier==='='?w.composition[k as Field]!.value/eq:null}));
const maximum=Math.max(...ions.map(x=>x.value??0),1);
---
<section><h2>Composizione dichiarata</h2><p class="small muted">— significa non disponibile. I simboli &lt; e &gt; restano parte del valore. Le unità possono essere diverse.</p><div class="table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Tabella della composizione"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Parametro</th><th scope="col">Valore</th><th scope="col">Unità</th><th scope="col">Fonte</th></tr></thead><tbody>{Object.entries(FIELDS).map(([key,[label,unit]])=><tr><th scope="row">{label}</th><td class="mono">{format(w.composition[key as Field])}</td><td>{unit||'senza unità'}</td><td>{w.composition[key as Field]?<a href="#provenienza">Documento · {w.period||w.analysis_date||'data assente'}</a>:'Non dichiarato'}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div>{ferruginosa(w.composition)&&<p>Ferruginosa: descrittore calcolato dal solo ferro bivalente dichiarato.</p>}</section><section class="panel"><h2>Ioni a colpo d’occhio</h2><p class="small muted">Scala comune in meq/L, calcolata dai valori esatti in mg/L. Nessuna valutazione di qualità. I dati mancanti o censurati non diventano barre.</p>{['Cationi','Anioni'].map((label,index)=><div><h3>{label}</h3>{ions.slice(index*4,index*4+4).map(ion=><div class="chart-row"><span>{ion.label}</span><div class="bar-track" aria-hidden="true">{ion.value!==null&&<div class="bar" style={`width:${100*ion.value/maximum}%`}></div>}</div><span class="mono">{ion.value===null?'—':ion.value.toFixed(2)}</span></div>)}</div>)}</section>
